Subject: [PATCH] vcpkg.json: trim to Avro-only deps + re-add jsoncons

This patch is applied automatically to a fresh libschemaregistry checkout
by ts_sal/bin/setup_functions.sh::build_libschemaregistry. It does two
things, both required for ts_sal's libschemaregistry build to succeed:

1. Trims cloud-vendor SDK dependencies (aws-sdk-cpp, azure-*,
   google-cloud-cpp, libvault, protobuf) from the vcpkg manifest. These
   are not needed for ts_sal's Avro-only build path
   (-DSCHEMAREGISTRY_WITH_AVRO=ON, everything else OFF), and they pull
   in very large transitive dependencies that complicate the build
   inside the ts_sal container.

2. Re-adds jsoncons to work around an upstream bug:
   src/serdes/SerdeTypes.cpp unconditionally `#include`s
   <jsoncons/json.hpp> even when configured with
   -DSCHEMAREGISTRY_WITH_JSON=OFF. Without this dependency present,
   the build fails with:
       fatal error: jsoncons/json.hpp: No such file or directory

Verified against libschemaregistry 0.1.3.

TODO: file the unconditional jsoncons include as an upstream issue at
https://github.com/confluentinc/libschemaregistry and link the issue
URL here. When upstream releases a fix, drop point 2 above (and
possibly retire this patch entirely if upstream also adds an
"Avro-only profile" preset that does the trimming in point 1).
---
diff --git a/vcpkg.json b/vcpkg.json
index 0b88aff..5e00312 100644
--- a/vcpkg.json
+++ b/vcpkg.json
@@ -4,28 +4,9 @@
   "dependencies": [
     "abseil",
     "avro-cpp",
-    {
-      "name": "aws-sdk-cpp",
-      "default-features": false,
-      "features": [
-        "kms",
-        "identity-management"
-      ]
-    },
-    "azure-identity-cpp",
-    "azure-security-keyvault-keys-cpp",
-    {
-      "name": "google-cloud-cpp",
-      "default-features": false,
-      "features": [
-        "kms"
-      ]
-    },
     "jsoncons",
-    "libvault",
     "nlohmann-json",
     "openssl",
-    "protobuf",
     "cpr"
   ]
 }
